WEBVTT

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.850
I couldn't move, again.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.630
I'm going to save them!

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.710
I'm the one who should've been eaten.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.920
I can't ignore this.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.370
They might still be alive.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.000
But, what will you do?

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.290
If we follow the path 
these pipes pass through,

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.790
it might take us to where 
Kanate and Ginchi are.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:09.810
But there will also be...

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.610
I know. Tsutsuga...

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:15.070
The Sho who rules over 
Gatoya might be there, too.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.330
It'll be dangerous, 
but to get out of here,

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.370
we'll have to meet him 
eventually anyway.

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:26.080
I'll protect you, no 
matter what happens.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.890
Yes. I trust you.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:37.170
Awakening

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.930
<i>You can't just sit there crying forever!</i>

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.360
<i>What's your name?</i>

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.770
<i>Ginchi...</i>

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.350
Ginchi...

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.060
Ginchi! Hey, Ginchi! You alive?!

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:05.980
Ginchi!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.210
Bro!

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.880
Just wait! I'm coming!

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.390
Foolish criminals.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.830
Who's there?!

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.670
I am Tsutsuga, the watchman of Gatoya.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.760
I will now judge your crimes.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:25.970
Tsutsuga?!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:30.880
Bro!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.420
Ginchi...

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.380
Which way should we go?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.080
Let's go!

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.910
Master Arata!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.480
Are you all right, Master Arata?!

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.510
It's you!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.170
Osome-san!

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:05.370
How nice. It looks like you found her.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.300
Come down here.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:10.310
No. We have to get to Tsutsuga, fast.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.390
What are you thinking?!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:16.570
I have to save some guys I know 
who just got eaten in The Reckoning.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:20.160
Don't talk nonsense! If you 
go, you'll be killed, too!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.990
But I can't leave them.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.260
Besides, if I don't do something,

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.470
we'll just live in fear of 
Tsutsuga's judgment every day.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.360
At least you'll still be alive!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.080
Hiding in fear... I know 
it's a miserable way to live,

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.800
but there's nothing we can do about it.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.350
Thanks, Osome-san.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.050
But I have to go.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.310
I'll be okay.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.090
If worst comes to worst, 
I'm a fast runner.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.720
You really are a good guy, Arata.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.430
Here.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:02.440
Don't you dare do anything to make 
that cute girlfriend of yours cry.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:04.520
Okay!

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.640
Warden Tsutsuga! Please, wait!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.530
Pleading for your life?

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.910
Then I shall give you one chance.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.140
Fight.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.730
Fight with the one you see before you.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:25.760
The winner will be declared 
innocent and set free.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.770
But that's...

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:31.090
Refuse, and you die.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.100
I can't do that!

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.810
Ginchi is like my little brother!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.660
Bro...

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.690
Then, you die.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.630
Bro!

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.890
Stop!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.550
Fight.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.890
Bro, I don't want to do this.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.360
I don't want to!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.230
Get up.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.980
Even if it's just one of us, the 
winner gets to leave this island.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.730
No!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:25.940
Shut up!

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:31.700
Where is it?

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:36.210
I'm sure we've come quite far down.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:38.940
Let's go!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.710
What's wrong with you, 
Ginchi?! Fight me!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:49.240
Kanate-san and Ginchi-kun are...

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.230
Why?

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.510
Yes.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.580
That's right.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.390
If you wish to survive, 
kill your opponent.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.850
No!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.600
Tsutsuga!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:03.900
Master Arata!

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.610
Tsutsuga!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.970
Make them stop this!

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:11.470
The Sho who cannot use his Hayagami...

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.580
I will not allow you to interfere 
with my sacred judgment.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.190
Those two are best friends!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.820
But they are criminals.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.380
But they're not bad guys!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.270
Do they appear that way to you?

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.130
Look.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.380
All people are the same.

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.000
They only care about themselves.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.930
They only want to save themselves.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.770
Those two are the same.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:45.980
No...

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:48.690
Bro! Stop it, Bro!

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:50.980
Stop calling me Bro!

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:54.530
You're not my little brother anymore!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.770
<i>Hinohara and I were never friends.</i>

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.790
Is it the same with you guys?

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.700
I'm gonna finish this!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.200
<i>This is the kid we nabbed yesterday.</i>

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.610
<i>You look after him, Kanate.</i>

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:34.320
<i>Drill him until he can 
work like a grown man.</i>

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.210
<i>What is that you've been 
holding all this time?</i>

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:41.710
<i>My mom's ring.</i>

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.070
<i>Oh...</i>

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.060
<i>Take good care of it.</i>

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:56.140
<i>I'll take you back to your mom someday.</i>

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:02.100
<i>Ginchi, you can get out...</i>

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:10.600
You did that for Ginchi, on purpose.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.090
The contest is over.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.280
The criminal is the boy who has lost.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.270
Bro!

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:23.580
And you, as well!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.790
I am the watchman who judges crimes.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:31.710
This boy has just committed a crime.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.050
The crime of murder.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:35.720
Tsutsuga...

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.100
Cut the crap!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.520
Bro...

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.970
So this is what the 
Reckoning really is?!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.240
You're just messing with their heads!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.440
These guys are not your toys!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.580
Quiet!

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.020
Bro!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.000
Kanate-san...

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:10.960
I'm sorry...

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.420
I'm sorry, Bro.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.720
Tsutsuga, where are you?! Show yourself!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:20.010
Master Arata!

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:31.860
The Reckoning again?

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.410
Master Arata!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.000
Hey, look at that!

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.290
Isn't he that kid from before?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.960
Arata!

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.590
Why does Lord Kannagi 
want to go to Gatoya?

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:05.070
Yeah. What does he want 
with that princess murderer?

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.840
The Sho who cannot use his Hayagami

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.690
thinks to oppose me?

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:19.280
<i>Damn it... Is this the end?</i>

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.010
Master Arata!

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.560
<i>Kotoha...</i>

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:30.540
I'm sorry, I can't...

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:33.130
<i>And I'll always believe...</i>

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:36.710
<i>I can only trust you.</i>

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.880
<i>That's right. I want to 
live up to their trust.</i>

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.760
Please, Hayagami...

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:50.090
Appear!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.440
Wh-What's that?!

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.500
This light... Is it that a Hayagami?

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.540
Bro...

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:18.740
Master Arata...

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.930
Is that a Hayagami?

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.500
That kid is a Sho?!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.700
Wow, he's blowing away Tsutsuga's 
pipes with the Hayagami!

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.700
He's a Sho?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.700
This light... That 
Hayagami couldn't be...

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.810
Tsutsuga!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.340
You're Tsutsuga?

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.590
A Hayagami? Why?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.440
You're in pain?

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.790
Be careful, Master Arata!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.240
Wh-What are you...

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.100
Is this...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.280
Tsutsuga's memory?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:05.140
<i>I see. You killed another by accident.</i>

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:08.520
<i>You are an old friend, 
but a crime is a crime.</i>

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.450
<i>Tsutsuga!</i>

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.220
<i>Repent and mend your ways.</i>

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:17.410
<i>When your heart itself changes, 
perhaps you can leave this island.</i>

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.280
<i>My friend, I trust in you.</i>

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.630
<i>What have you...</i>

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:31.240
<i>You tell me to repent? 
You call me your friend?!</i>

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.060
<i>And with that righteous 
look on your face!</i>

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:36.370
<i>Die!</i>

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:47.360
<i>You would betray a friend 
who trusted you.</i>

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.340
<i>Curse you!</i>

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:02.110
<i>I suppose humans are all 
the same after all.</i>

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:09.270
<i>In that case, this Hayagami and I 
shall become not a god, but a demon!</i>

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.390
<i>With the power of a demon,</i>

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.520
<i>I will imprison all sinners for eternity!</i>

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:24.680
How dare you look unbidden into my soul?

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:29.760
As if you could even 
understand what I feel.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.570
Just hurry up and finish me off.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.740
Kill him!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.080
Avenge all those people he's taken!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.090
Kill him!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.970
Kill Tsutsuga!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.290
Subside.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.740
Wh-What are you doing?

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.120
What is he...

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.390
He's not trying to save him, is he?!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.620
Fool...

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:06.270
You cannot defy a demonized Hayagami.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.920
Hate... Hate...

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:16.670
Hate!

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:21.290
Hinohara and I were never friends.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.370
Hate!

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.500
I won't acknowledge you.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.500
Hate!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.260
Take vengeance on the traitor!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.540
Vengeance!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.130
Vengeance!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.450
Now I see. You are like me.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.900
Betrayed by a friend, 
left to become a demon...

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.650
No!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:52.430
He was still... He was still

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.570
an important friend to me!

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:00.540
Arata...

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.940
<i>I still...</i>

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.750
I still don't understand!

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.000
I don't understand people at all!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.900
But you shouldn't stay here alone!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:17.890
What can resentment 
and suffering do for you?!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.020
I'll save you! 
Whatever it takes, I'll save you!

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:50.460
Why? Why would you go so far?

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:55.300
When I saw your past, it hurt.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.780
It was just like mine.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.050
I trusted him, and it stung 
when he betrayed me.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:04.350
But in truth, I still want to trust him.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.670
I want to forgive him.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:12.030
So, if I'd tested someone's trust 
and been hurt again,

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.860
I might have ended up like you did.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.180
You've been in pain 
for a long time, huh?

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.490
Oh, man, I must look ridiculous.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.670
I have been watching you.

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.490
Perhaps this is what I wanted.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:38.390
Perhaps, in my heart, 
I wished for you to stop me.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.600
The Hayagami...

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:48.600
That is the true form of Saniwa, 
the Hayagami of judgment.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.480
Tsutsuga!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.540
You are called Arata, correct?

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:59.240
I believe you have what it takes 
to wield Saniwa with justice.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.760
The Hayagami...

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:15.270
Hayagami Saniwa, submit now 
to the great Sho before me.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:20.590
My life shall be as one 
with the great Hayagami.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.230
Now that the Hayagami and my 
life are submitted to you,

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.150
my duty is fulfilled.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:38.480
I shall henceforth live 
within your Hayagami.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:44.160
The Kamui of Saniwa now belongs to you.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.560
Show it to me, Arata the Sho.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:53.740
Return Gatoya to what it 
once was, as its new warden.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.570
Appear, Saniwa!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.700
This is...

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.000
Gatoya is changing...

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:36.610
Hey, look!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.230
It's the guys who were taken 
in the Hour of Reckoning!

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.510
They're alive?!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:49.720
Masahi...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.550
Masahi!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.420
Osome...

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.230
Thank you...

00:20:57.970 --> 00:20:59.880
Thank you, Arata.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.040
Arata...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.870
You are in danger. Leave now.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:11.590
Where is Arata?

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:14.200
I-If you want the Sho, 
he's on the lowest level.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.420
Warden Tsutsuga lost.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.880
What?!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.040
Kanate-san, where're we going?

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.560
If this island is back to how it was,

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.800
our old home is probably back, too!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.310
Tsutsuga?!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.370
Kannagi?

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:33.680
What do the Twelve Shinsho 
want with that innocent boy?

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.690
You submitted to him?!

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.080
Arata is strong.

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.470
Is this...

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.800
You two lived inside a boat?

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:50.580
And that boy's Hayagami

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.790
is the sword of origins that 
will rule over this world.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:57.730
The sword of origins?

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:06.000
Let's go to the capital 
and find the princess!

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:43.590
My wound aches, Emisu.

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.320
So you're a Sho, too.

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:50.050
Strangely enough, he had 
the same name as you.

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:54.760
Hayagami, Sho... What am I even doing?

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:55.260
Zokusho
